{"id": "68975", "title": "以谁之名，默默爱你", "author": "疯子三三", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 14, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68975.htm", "intro": "易小聊是轻度智障，思维什么都很JP\r\n所以……当她被天天欺压自己的竹马给吻了的时候\r\n\r\n“柏笙，为什么要伸舌头？”\r\n“闭嘴！”\r\n“易小聊，你嘴闭那么紧干嘛？”\r\n“你让我，闭嘴的……”\r\n“……乖，张嘴。”\r\n“柏笙。”\r\n“嗯？”\r\n“为什么……嗯，到底为什么要……伸舌头。”\r\n“……”\r\n“柏笙？”\r\n“因为……相濡以沫，我想和小聊……相濡以沫一辈子。”\r\n“柏笙，你个变态，要我吃你口水，还要一辈子！”\r\n“……”\r\n\r\n一句话文案：卧底警察和一个轻度智障彪悍小色女的故事 (1VS1，结局HE)\r\n\r\n本文Bug多多，经不起考究 ^_^ 要求高者慎入~\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 情有独钟 青梅竹马 高干", "base": "files/article/html/68/68975", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10553311.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10553312.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10553313.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10553314.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10553315.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10553316.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "10553317.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10553318.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10553319.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "10553320.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "10553321.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "10553322.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "10553323.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10553324.html", "available": false}]}